  // Screen 08 - Gameplay, the table (GDD §11 T rules + screen 08). Rects are mockup pixels on 08-gameplay.png.
  // Everything is shared kit (ArtSource/Kit/*.map.csv): header discs and their shadows, the logo, the home /
  // scorecard / settings / emote icons, the trump spade, avatar ring and avatar, the name plate and the
  // status pill (sliced left and right, scaled to each seat's height), the timer ring (a radial fill at runtime)
  // and its seconds badge, and the round ornament (one sprite; the customizer mirrors the right one). Icons are
  // placed at the rects the icons map gives (the whole texture, no shape). The header divider is a drawn hairline.
  // Cards are never nodes: the hand, the trick and the opponents' fans are built at runtime from the deck
  // sprites. Their areas are plain rects here so the plate is cleared under them and the view gets a
  // container at the measured place (SeatFan*, TrickArea, HandArea).
  // Seats are numbered by relative position (GDD T rules): 0 bottom (you), 1 right, 2 top, 3 left.
  "name": "Table",
  "mockup": "08-gameplay.png",
  "plate": {
    "generated": "ArtSource/Working/Table/BG_Table_Plate_16x9.png",
    "generatedWide": "ArtSource/Working/Table/BG_Table_Plate_Wide.png"
  },
  "nodes": [
    // ---- Plate only: along the four edges the plate fades into the wide painting, so 21:9 and 4:3 screens show no
